  m_text: "A virus has entered a game and camouflaged itself as a plant. \n\nYou
    must find the virus and destroy it. A virus can replicate the appearance of an
    object, but can't fully replicate its interactions.\n\nTransfer yourself into
    other objects in the game to discover how they interact with the plants. Compare
    their reactions and identify the outlier.\n\nDo not destroy any other object
    other than the virus. It will break the game permanently.\n\nWASD to move"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
